"""Street Legends frontend: Scrabble Table house item - Scrabble PvC,
PLAYER VS PLAYER rooms + PvP game, MOVE / SELL ($10,000 back).
Run from repo root: python3 frontend/patch-house-scrabble-frontend-dict.py
Idempotent - safe to re-run.
Word list: downloads the 359,800-word list from GitHub
(frontend/scrabble-dict.txt) and inserts it into both game files.
If the download fails, nothing is changed and the old word list stays.
Same proven pattern as pool + darts + cards, with one fix baked in: the menu
render line is written WITH onPlayPvp in the first place, so no later wiring
patch (and no global "already wired" check) is needed.
FRONTEND ONLY - reload Expo Go to check. Rooms work once the backend scrabble
rooms endpoints are live; if the backend is not live yet, the rooms screen
says so instead of crashing.
"""
